repeated start sequence is generated if the MSMS = 1.
} Bits {0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8} Readable 0 ID Start Writeable 1 Name Start} {ParentID TX_FIFO Description {The dynamic stop bit can be used to send an IIC stop
