} Bits {0 1 2 3} Readable 1 ID Occupancy_Value Writeable 0 Name Occupancy_Value} {ParentID axi_iic_0 Description {Slave Ten Bit Address Register} Size 32 Readable 1 ID TEN_ADR Writeable 1 MemoryAddress 1096810780 Name TEN_ADR} {ParentID TEN_ADR Description {Three MSBs of the 10-bit address used by the AXI IIC bus interface when in slave mode.
