} Bits {0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7} Readable 1 ID Manual_Slave_Select_Assertion_Enable Writeable 1 Name Manual_Slave_Select_Assertion_Enable} {ParentID SPICR Description {Master transaction inhibit
This bit inhibits master transactions.
