} Bits {0 1 2 3 4} Readable 1 ID ARHT0 Writeable 1 Name ARHT0} {ParentID TCSR0 Description {Load Timer 0      0 = No load      1 = Loads timer with value in TLR0 Setting this bit loads timer/counter register (TCR0) with a specified value in the timer/counter load register (TLR0).  This bit prevents the running of the timer/counter; hence, this should be cleared alongside setting Enable Timer/ Counter (ENT0) bit in TCSR0.
} Bits {0 1 2 3 4 5} Readable 1 ID LOAD0 Writeable 1 Name LOAD0} {ParentID TCSR0 Description {Enable Interrupt for Timer 0
