} Bits {0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8} Readable 1 ID Master_Transaction_Inhibit Writeable 1 Name Master_Transaction_Inhibit} {ParentID SPICR Description {LSB first
This bit selects LSB first data transfer format.
